INSERT INTO policy_versions(id,kind,version,document_zh_cn,document_en) VALUES
('b4cf4554-e3ae-40fb-b04f-d3cf6b94963a','private_chat_reply_speech',1,
'私聊回应 AI 合成朗读
只有你在私聊中主动选择一条已保存的 AI 文字回应进行合成，西界才向 OpenAI 发送该回应的文字生成标准 AI 合成语音。这不是人物本人声音。不使用原声样本、麦克风、照片、其他消息、人物资料或记忆，不克隆声线，不自动生成或播放。
需要当前的私人文字保存与本用途授权。正式环境另需正式 AI 服务许可和运营启用。音频是同一账号下与原回应绑定的私人资料，重新播放同一条会使用已生成的文件。该功能有长度和保存数量限制。撤回本授权会停止新处理和播放，并阻止未完成音频发布。重新允许不会恢复旧任务。撤回无法收回已传给服务方的文字。当前音频可以随仍可见的来源导出，移除回应或注销账号会清除对应音频。',
'AI speech for direct-chat replies
Only when you choose to synthesize one saved AI text reply in a direct chat does Xijie send the text of that reply to OpenAI for a standard synthesized AI voice. It is not the person’s own voice. Original voice samples, microphones, photos, other messages, character details and memories are excluded. It does not clone a voice, generate automatically, or autoplay.
Current private text storage and this purpose grant are required. Production also requires authorization for production AI service and operator approval. The audio is private, associated with the reply in the same account, and replay uses the saved file. Limits apply to length and storage. Withdrawal stops generation and playback and prevents unfinished audio from being published; granting again does not resume old jobs. Withdrawal cannot recall text already sent to the provider. Audio attached to still-visible sources can be exported. Removing the reply or erasing the account removes the associated audio.');
